# HTTP examples for module 10-elasticsearch. Run them from IntelliJ IDEA / VS Code (REST Client).
# Start the lesson first: ./mvnw -pl modules/10-elasticsearch/lesson spring-boot:run

### Lesson 3.3/3.5 — full-text search with hits, highlights and category facets
GET http://localhost:8080/api/search?q=java

### Filters: only one category, at most 60
GET http://localhost:8080/api/search?q=java&category=programming&maxPrice=60

### The Turkish analyzer: "kitap" finds "kitaplar", "istanbul" finds "İstanbul"
GET http://localhost:8080/api/search?q=kitap

### Look at the index directly: the mapping Spring Data created
GET http://localhost:9200/books/_mapping

### How the Turkish analyzer splits a text
POST http://localhost:9200/_analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{ "analyzer": "turkish", "text": "İstanbul'daki kitapçılar" }
